                    "documentation": "The bound on this value: the true value lies between `value - minus` and `value + plus`, in the canonical unit (seconds). Asymmetric when the uncertainty is one-sided (a clock time written to the minute is minus 0 / plus 59 s). ABSENT means no tolerance is stated. A bound, not a standard deviation (CHANGE 7).",
